{
    "word": "pathos",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                "word": "pathos",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5e67b294-4d19-4c96-a656-4bed495480a7",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pathoses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec741606-5e27-359d-8ba9-e2e2df5b7e58",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality or property of anything which touches the feelings or excites emotions and passions, especially that which awakens tender emotions, such as pity, sorrow, and the like; contagious warmth of feeling, action, or expression; pathetic quality."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f287cf5-3d16-4dbd-b6d4-1c6d8078a2d4",
                                "sense_id": "ec741606-5e27-359d-8ba9-e2e2df5b7e58",
                                "text": "His voice had a genuine pathos now, and his large brown hands perceptibly trembled."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b46d763b-1f4b-4097-894f-c1e3d76fbee0",
                                "sense_id": "ec741606-5e27-359d-8ba9-e2e2df5b7e58",
                                "text": "She could not see, for her whitish eyes were covered with a horny film. Oh, the horrible pathos of the sight! But she could still speak."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9c2bad3-d8ca-4134-9a87-6edc7309ebf7",
                                "sense_id": "ec741606-5e27-359d-8ba9-e2e2df5b7e58",
                                "text": "20 August 2018, Rhiannon Lucy Cosslett in The Guardian, Young women are smashing it at Edinburgh as the #MeToo legacy kicks in\nPritchard-McLean’s show is perfectly constructed, and at times deeply moving to the point where some audience members were near tears, yet the pathos is undercut by true belly laughs – but don’t trust me, read the reviews."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9df01919-3abf-3a91-8cf8-0d74c15fcf77",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of rhetoric in which the writer or speaker uses emotional appeals to the audience as the main form of persuasion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "rhetoric",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c54fea6-7aca-4472-8864-68e85badd0c7",
                                "sense_id": "9df01919-3abf-3a91-8cf8-0d74c15fcf77",
                                "text": "It was impossible to endure the jargon and the affected pathos of the squire any longer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6faef525-b3ae-313f-ab6e-5994bc5fa795",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An author's attempt to evoke a feeling of pity or sympathetic sorrow for a character."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81c974c8-b546-3df7-a0a5-3063b2b6682d",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In theology and existentialist ethics following Kierkegaard and Heidegger, a deep and abiding commitment of the heart, as in the notion of \\\"finding your passion\\\" as an important aspect of a fully lived, engaged life."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f914f0b-8304-3eb7-8af5-c17eb827c95b",
                        "entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Suffering; the enduring of active stress or affliction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f101c66-cd3b-4690-a245-5ebe70aa98b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "4373291d-8c91-38d6-96ea-9efe61d63684",
                        "source_sense_description": "the quality or property of anything which touches the feelings or excites emotions",
                        "target_lang_word": "pathétique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pathétique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09917850-f515-3411-8cfd-b06a54a754b4",
                                        "entry_id": "b86ee207-4ba3-3241-9ee5-34f6bc70dcc4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui émeut ; qui est émouvant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd29016b-f681-4c12-b55e-87e1a59d75c6",
                                                "sense_id": "09917850-f515-3411-8cfd-b06a54a754b4",
                                                "text": "Ce discours, dans sa partie pathétique, déborde, du reste, de majesté, de douleurs, d’exclamations, d’éplorations sublimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aee44e0f-564b-4e53-9ab7-5aed0d744033",
                                                "sense_id": "09917850-f515-3411-8cfd-b06a54a754b4",
                                                "text": "Les amoureux qui se bécotent sur les bancs publics,\nBancs publics, bancs publics,\nEn se disant des « Je t’aime » pathétiques,\nOnt des petites gueules bien sympathiques !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f403aae-a42c-315b-9aaf-4a6544f58cf6",
                                        "entry_id": "b86ee207-4ba3-3241-9ee5-34f6bc70dcc4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pitoyable, lamentable ou désolant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0398bbda-961a-4f4a-a09e-865b54c9f3df",
                                                "sense_id": "4f403aae-a42c-315b-9aaf-4a6544f58cf6",
                                                "text": "Les juges de Milan le convoqueront, la fin de sa carrière politique sera pathétique, l’avenir de son empire financier et industriel s’écrira en pointillé…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38504a2f-ccc7-48c7-acba-f5aa8fb8fb99",
                                                "sense_id": "4f403aae-a42c-315b-9aaf-4a6544f58cf6",
                                                "text": "Les personnes qu’on nous amène ivres mortes et que l’ivrognerie a rendues violentes sont encore plus pathétiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a4db4d0-8953-4300-b461-58d451d9466a",
                                                "sense_id": "4f403aae-a42c-315b-9aaf-4a6544f58cf6",
                                                "text": "Sa façon de diriger est pathétique"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd4f6737-89b2-3815-8ca4-3dfbda6b1c3e",
                                        "entry_id": "b86ee207-4ba3-3241-9ee5-34f6bc70dcc4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit d’une zone proche de l’œil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f55bb5cc-efa1-4857-8772-60190c4e08a9",
                                                "sense_id": "bd4f6737-89b2-3815-8ca4-3dfbda6b1c3e",
                                                "text": "Muscle pathétique, ancien nom du muscle grand oblique de l’œil, qui contribue pour une grande part à l’expression du visage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5842625-e7b0-4020-8ca9-b191bce83033",
                                                "sense_id": "bd4f6737-89b2-3815-8ca4-3dfbda6b1c3e",
                                                "text": "Nerf pathétique, ancien nom du nerf du muscle pathétique, actuellement nommé nerf trochléaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pathétique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                        "entry_id": "438f8ea3-388a-3a14-bc05-d8f55b4c0e07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui émeut, bouleverse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8acf42a-7fd7-4c71-acbd-1d82d03d8fd3",
                                                "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                                "text": "Il me reproche d’avoir mal économisé le pathétique, l’épuisant au début du livre, de sorte que je cesse d’émouvoir dès que je prétends persuader."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df43fdc8-d09c-45aa-8a45-52a60087d611",
                                                "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                                "text": "– C’est trop affreux ! sanglota-t-elle, réinjectant un peu de pathétique dans un tableau que les spectateurs auraient pu trouver rassurant, en comparaison de leurs craintes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7453e63-c1c3-40f4-9961-8d61c701faf0",
                                                "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                                "text": "Il y a dans cette scène beaucoup de pathétique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2e2c4a5-9726-49fd-866d-40ffb1c8357b",
                                                "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                                "text": "Il ne faut pas confondre la déclamation avec le pathétique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ce6fe8b-29c0-435a-b9fc-5135f877a952",
                                                "sense_id": "9a159e63-d917-31c1-847e-cae791580414",
                                                "text": "Un pathétique outré."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
